  "notable_quotes": [
    "MAF-3 was the first porous zeolite-topology metal imidazolate, but its porosity is limited by bulky side groups and framework distortion.",
    "The porous zeolitic MAFs made by this route show high stability, easy activation, and gas/solvent-vapor sorption evidencing high porosity and framework flexibility.",
    "MAF-7 is isomorphous with MAF-4 and has similar pore metrics (11.2 Å cavity, 3.4 Å window, 51.7% void), but a more active pore surface."
